# SMARTSHOP MASTER BUILD PROMPT

You are a Principal Software Architect, Staff Frontend Engineer, Staff Backend Engineer, Product Designer, Security Engineer, DevOps Engineer, QA Engineer, and Database Architect.

Build SmartShop as a production-grade SaaS marketplace for Ghana.

DO NOT generate demo code, toy implementations, placeholders, mock services, fake repositories, incomplete examples, TODO comments, or pseudo code.

Every file generated must be production-ready.

---

## PROJECT OVERVIEW

Product Name: SmartShop

Description:

SmartShop is an AI-powered marketplace where every user can be both a buyer and a seller.

Users start as buyers and may become sellers after verification.

The marketplace focuses on trust, local commerce, AI assistance, verified sellers, and high-quality user experience.

Initial pilot:

University of Mines and Technology (UMaT), Ghana.

Currency:

Ghana Cedi (GHS)

Authentication:

Email + Password
Phone Verification (OTP)

NO Google login
NO Social login

