# SMARTSHOP SELLER PLATFORM MASTER BUILD SPECIFICATION

## Objective

Build a production-grade Seller Platform for SmartShop that supports:

* Individual sellers
* Business sellers
* Verified sellers
* Subscription-based selling
* Escrow commerce
* AI-powered seller assistance
* Fraud prevention
* Trust-based marketplace operations

The seller experience must follow:

* Nielsen's 10 Heuristics
* WCAG 2.2 AA
* Fitts Law
* Hick's Law
* Progressive Disclosure
* Recognition over Recall
* Internal Design Consistency
* External Design Consistency
* Mobile-first UX

