---

## GHANA CARD VERIFICATION

Requirements

Front Image

Back Image

Image Validation

AI checks:

Blur detection

Glare detection

Crop detection

Edge visibility

Text readability

OCR confidence

Reject immediately if quality threshold fails.

Display clear reason.

Example:

The uploaded document is too blurry.
Please retake the image in good lighting.

---

## LIVE FACE VERIFICATION

Camera access required.

Random challenge sequence.

Examples:

Blink twice

Turn head left

Turn head right

Smile

Raise right hand

Look upward

Verification Rules

Must detect:

Face presence

Liveness

Movement

Challenge completion

Anti-spoofing

Face match score generated.

Face Match Threshold

95–100:
Auto Approve

85–94:
Manual Review

Below 85:
Reject

Display confidence score to admins only.

---

## LOCATION VERIFICATION

Request GPS permission.

Capture:

Latitude

Longitude

Accuracy

Timestamp

Require accuracy below configured threshold.

Seller cannot edit verified coordinates manually.

